    "chunk_text": "\u00d0ONNE man niwan wif nim\u00f0, ne fare he ut to gefeohte, ne him nan man utf\u00e6reld ne beode, ac beo Gyf \u00e6nig man sylle his bro\u00f0or wi\u00fe wur\u00f0e, si he ofslagen. Nafa \u00f0u nanes \u00f0earfan wedd mid \u00f0e nihtlangne fyrst, ac agyf hit him sona \u00e6r sunnan setlgange, \u00f0\u00e6t Ne slea man f\u00e6deras for suna gylton, ne suna for f\u00e6dera gylton, ac swelte anra gehwylc for his GYF twegen gebro\u00f0ra eardia\u00f0 \u00e6tsamne, & hyra o\u00f0er bi\u00f0 dead butan bearnum, ne nime \u00f0\u00e6s Gyf he \u00f0onne nelle niman his bro\u00f0or lafe, \u00fee him seo \u00e6 bebyt to h\u00e6bbenne, fare \u00f0\u00e6t wif to \u00f0am Clypie hine man \u00f0yder & axie hine be \u00f0am \u00f0ingum; gyf he \u00f0onne cwy\u00f0: Nelle ic hi habban to wife; & H\u00e6bbe \u00e6lc man rihtne anmittan, & rihte w\u00e6ga, & rihte gemetu on \u00e6lcum \u00feincge, \u00f0\u00e6t hi na\u00f0er ne MOYSES & \u00f0a sacerdas of Leuies cynne cw\u00e6don to eallum Israhela folce: La Israhel, ongyt \u00f0\u00e6t \u00f0u Gehyr his word & his beboda & his rihtwisnyssa, \u00f0e ic eow bebeode. And Moyses cw\u00e6\u00f0 to \u00f0am folce: \u00f0is synd \u00f0a \u00f0e sculon standan & bletsian Drihten uppan Gazarim & \u00f0as sceolon standan on Hebal dune to wyrgenne: Ruben & Gad, Aser & Zabulon, Dan & & \u00f0a sacerdas of Leuies cynne cwe\u00f0a\u00f0 to Israhela folce hlud",
